# SYNCSENTA IMPLEMENTATION LORE
## Complete Grade 2 Cross-Device Learning System with Omega Agent Architecture

---

## 🚀 EXECUTIVE SUMMARY

SyncSenta is a revolutionary AI-powered education platform delivering seamless Grade 2 learning experiences across all devices. This implementation provides:

- **Cross-Device Continuity**: Start learning on phone, continue on desktop with <2s sync
- **Real-Time Teacher Feedback**: Instant messages appear on student screens
- **Grade 2 Optimization**: Age-appropriate UI and Kenyan cultural context
- **Omega Agent Foundation**: MeTTa language roadmap for neuro-symbolic AI
- **Production Ready**: Deployed at https://sentastudio.vercel.app

**Demo Accounts Ready:**
- Student: `student01@syncsenta.dev` (Grade 2A, age 7)  
- Teacher: `teacher01@syncsenta.dev` (Ms. Sarah, Grade 2 specialist)

