## 🏗️ SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE

### Current Production Stack
```
Frontend: Next.js 14 + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS
Backend: Supabase (PostgreSQL + Real-time + Auth)
Session Cache: Upstash Redis (cross-device persistence)
Real-time: Supabase Realtime + WebSocket connections
Deployment: Vercel (sentastudio.vercel.app)
CDN: Global edge caching with automatic scaling
```

### Future Omega Agent Stack
```
AI Engine: SingularityNET OpenCog Hyperon + MeTTa
Knowledge Store: Distributed AtomSpace (MongoDB + Redis)
Reasoning: Neuro-symbolic AI with cultural context
Agents: Multi-agent tutoring ecosystem in MeTTa
Scale: Millions of students with personalized paths
```

