## 🧠 OMEGA AGENT RESEARCH INTEGRATION

### MeTTa Language Educational Framework
The Omega agent represents the future evolution of SyncSenta into a neuro-symbolic AI system using MeTTa language for educational reasoning.

### 24-Week Implementation Roadmap

**Phase 1: Foundation (Weeks 1-8)**
- Set up OpenCog Hyperon development environment
- Convert Grade 2 CBC curriculum to MeTTa symbolic representations
- Implement basic competency tracking in MeTTa syntax
- Migrate Lesson Architect agent from Python to MeTTa

**Phase 2: Cultural Integration (Weeks 9-16)**
- Encode Kenyan cultural context in AtomSpace knowledge base
- Implement Kiswahili language processing with MeTTa
- Create culturally-aware activity generation algorithms
- Deploy distributed AtomSpace across MongoDB + Redis

**Phase 3: Advanced Reasoning (Weeks 17-24)**
- Multi-agent tutoring ecosystem in MeTTa language
- Personalized learning path optimization using symbolic reasoning
- Real-time adaptation based on student emotional and cognitive state
- Integration with SingularityNET for decentralized AI services

### MeTTa Code Example (Competency Assessment)
```metta
;; Define Grade 2 mathematics competency framework
(: grade2-math-competencies (-> Student CompetencyLevel))
(= (grade2-math-competencies $student)
   (match &competency-space
     (competency counting $student $level numbers-1-20)
     (if (> $level 3) 
         (unlock-activity $student advanced-counting)
         (recommend-practice $student basic-counting))))

;; Cultural adaptation for Kenyan context
