### Manual Testing Protocol
**Cross-Device Continuity Test (2 minutes)**:
1. Phone: Visit https://sentastudio.vercel.app/auth/signup
2. Phone: Click "🎒 Join as Student" → Auto-login as Grade 2 student
3. Phone: Start "Number Garden", drag 5 flowers (25% progress)
4. Desktop: Same URL, same login → Verify flowers preserved
5. Desktop: Complete activity → Verify 100% completion
6. Phone: Refresh → Verify completion status synced

**Teacher Feedback Test (3 minutes)**:
1. Desktop: Click "📚 Join as Teacher" → Auto-login as Ms. Sarah
2. Desktop: Send encouragement: "Great counting! 🌟"
3. Phone: Verify instant message appearance with notification
4. Phone: Respond with thumbs up emoji
5. Desktop: Verify teacher sees student response immediately

